cussion, Commander. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"This is the only thing we can do. We can't possibly hold off a Paradeus force of this magnitude. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"This is not despair talking, but a lucid, informed decision."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"VP1915","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Perosa","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We're leaving the Commander in your hands."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":4,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Perosa!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Perosa looks back at the Commander."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"VP1915","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Perosa","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Commander... I am very grateful for your compassion. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But this is a unanimous decision of Squad Griffin. Let us stay behind to delay them."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Why? Why do you have to do this? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You can work with the AR Team and we can escape together!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"VP1915","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Perosa","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Haven't you seen how powerful Narciss is?! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Not even the AR Team can stand up to her! We can't all get out of this with just the lot of us!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Explode","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Boom!!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Kolibri","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kolibri","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Are you 